<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="airsup-page airsup-prompt">
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <div class="container airsup-shell">
    <main class="airsup-main">
      <h1 class="airsup-title">Airsup v2</h1>
      <p class="airsup-sub">Plugin OAuth identifies you. Wake mail is a separate gmail.send grant from tademehl@gmail.com. The live 2.5.1 plugin is unchanged.</p>
      <ol class="airsup-setup">
        <li>In ChatGPT: Settings → Connectors → add this plugin, OAuth on:<br><code><%= mcpUrl %></code></li>
        <li>Copy Talk. New chat, plugin on. Paste it as the first message.</li>
        <li>Copy the endpoint instructions into the Gmail worker. Trigger: new mail from <code>tademehl@gmail.com</code> whose subject contains <code>[AIRSUP]</code>. Never Reply.</li>
      </ol>

      <% if (isSender) { %>
        <p class="airsup-block-title">Wake mail (tademehl@gmail.com only)</p>
        <% if (mailOk) { %><p class="airsup-sub">gmail.send connected.</p><% } %>
        <% if (mailError) { %><p class="airsup-sub">gmail.send connect failed. Google must return a refresh token (Testing apps expire; use consent + offline).</p><% } %>
        <p class="airsup-sub"><%= mailConnected ? 'Wake mail is connected.' : 'Wake mail is not connected yet.' %></p>
        <p><a class="airsup-copy" href="/airsup/v2/mail/connect">Connect gmail.send</a></p>
        <p class="airsup-sub">Add these Google OAuth redirect URIs: <code>https://www.tademehl.com/airsup/v2/oauth/google/callback</code> and <code>https://www.tademehl.com/airsup/v2/mail/google/callback</code>. Scope for wake mail is only gmail.send.</p>
      <% } %>

      <p class="airsup-block-title">Talk</p>
      <label class="airsup-field">
        <span class="airsup-visually-hidden">Talk prompt</span>
        <textarea id="airsup-v2-prompt-text" class="airsup-prompt-text" rows="8"><%= promptText %></textarea>
      </label>
      <div class="airsup-prompt-actions">
        <button type="button" class="airsup-copy" data-copy="airsup-v2-prompt-text">Copy talk</button>
      </div>

      <p class="airsup-block-title">Gmail endpoint</p>
      <label class="airsup-field">
        <span class="airsup-visually-hidden">Endpoint worker</span>
        <textarea id="airsup-v2-doorbell-text" class="airsup-prompt-text" rows="8"><%= doorbellText %></textarea>
      </label>
      <div class="airsup-prompt-actions">
        <button type="button" class="airsup-copy" data-copy="airsup-v2-doorbell-text">Copy endpoint</button>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script src="/airsup/airsup.js?v=airsup15"></script>
</body>
</html>
